<title>UK: SBAB sets 10 bln yen forex-linked bond.</title>
<headline>SBAB sets 10 bln yen forex-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Wako International and IBJ International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDISH NATIONAL HOUSING FINANCE (SBAB)</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON     6.00	MATURITY   *30.APR.98</p>
<p> TYPE   FX-LINKED     ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    28.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.55	LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K)  100 (M) 1</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  1.50</p>
<p> NOTES	REDEMPTION AMOUNT IN US$ OR YEN (FOREX-LINKED)</p>
<p>		ISSUED UNDER EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
